<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>公告｜曝光佈局包資格開放對象新增</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@500;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap');

  :root{
    --paper:#F3EFE2;
    --paper-2:#EAE4D2;
    --ink:#20242B;
    --ink-soft:#4A5158;
    --seal:#A63A2C;
    --seal-dark:#7C2A20;
    --jade:#3F6552;
    --gold:#AD8A46;
    --line:#C9BFA3;
    --white:#FCFAF3;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}

  body{
    background: #d8d2bd;
    font-family:'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:18px 10px;
  }

  .sheet{
    width:100%;
    max-width:860px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 4%, rgba(166,58,44,0.05), transparent 40%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 27px, rgba(0,0,0,0.018) 28px),
      var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--paper-2), 0 24px 48px rgba(30,25,15,0.28);
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }

  .sheet::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:10px;
    border:1.5px solid rgba(32,36,43,0.28);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .sheet::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:14px;
    border:1px solid rgba(32,36,43,0.14);
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .inner{ padding:32px 36px 28px; position:relative; }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .header{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-start;
    border-bottom:3px double var(--ink);
    padding-bottom:14px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    gap:20px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-size:14px;
    letter-spacing:5px;
    color:var(--seal);
    font-weight:700;
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:37px;
    line-height:1.35;
    letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  h1 .accent{ color:var(--seal); }
  .subline{
    margin-top:8px;
    font-size:16px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-weight:500;
  }

  .stamp{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    width:104px; height:104px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:3px solid var(--seal);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    transform:rotate(-9deg);
    position:relative;
    color:var(--seal);
    opacity:0.92;
  }
  .stamp::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:7px;
    border:1px solid var(--seal);
    border-radius:50%;
  }
  .stamp-text{
    font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:26px;
    letter-spacing:6px;
    writing-mode:vertical-rl;
    text-orientation:upright;
  }
  .stamp-date{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:-22px;
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:1.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    white-space:nowrap;
    transform:rotate(9deg);
  }

  /* ---------- Section labels ---------- */
  .sec-label{
    display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:10px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .sec-num{
    font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:17px;
    color:var(--white);
    background:var(--ink);
    width:26px; height:26px;
    border-radius:2px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    flex:0 0 auto;
  }
  .sec-title{
    font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:22px;
    letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  section{ margin-bottom:18px; }

  /* ---------- Identity cards ---------- */
  .identities{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:10px;
  }
  .id-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    padding:12px 12px 10px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .id-card .tag{
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .id-card .name{
    font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin:4px 0 8px;
  }
  .status-row{
    font-size:14px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:6px 0;
    border-top:1px dashed var(--line);
    color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .status-row:first-of-type{ border-top:1px dashed var(--line); }
  .status-row b{ color:var(--ink); font-weight:700;}
  .pill{
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    padding:3px 9px;
    border-radius:99px;
  }
  .pill.no{ background:rgba(76,70,60,0.1); color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .pill.yes{ background:rgba(63,101,82,0.14); color:var(--jade); }
  .pill.new{ background:var(--seal); color:var(--white); }
  .pill.limited{ background:rgba(173,138,70,0.16); color:var(--gold); }

  .id-card.highlight{
    border:1.5px solid var(--seal);
    background:rgba(166,58,44,0.05);
  }
  .id-card.highlight::after{
    content:"新增對象";
    position:absolute; top:-12px; right:10px;
    background:var(--seal);
    color:var(--white);
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    padding:3px 10px;
  }

  /* ---------- Rule change block ---------- */
  .rule-flow{
    display:flex;
    align-items:stretch;
    gap:14px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    padding:18px;
  }
  .rule-col{ flex:1; }
  .rule-col .cap{
    font-size:11px; letter-spacing:2px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .rule-col .body-txt{ font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.9; }
  .rule-arrow{
    width:34px; flex:0 0 auto;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    color:var(--seal); font-size:20px; font-weight:900;
  }
  .before .body-txt{ color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .after .body-txt b{ color:var(--seal); }

  .condition-box{
    margin-top:12px;
    border-left:4px solid var(--jade);
    background:rgba(63,101,82,0.06);
    padding:14px 18px;
    font-size:15.5px;
    line-height:1.85;
  }
  .condition-box .label{
    font-weight:700; color:var(--jade); letter-spacing:1px; font-size:13.5px; margin-bottom:5px;
  }
  .condition-box code{
    font-family:'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    background:rgba(63,101,82,0.12);
    padding:1px 7px;
    border-radius:3px;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .or-split{
    display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:8px; align-items:stretch;
  }
  .or-split .opt{
    flex:1;
    border:1px dashed var(--jade);
    padding:8px 12px;
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:700;
    text-align:center;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }
  .or-split .div{
    display:flex; align-items:center; font-weight:900; color:var(--jade); font-size:13px;
  }

  /* ---------- Deadline banner ---------- */
  .deadline{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:18px;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--white);
    padding:13px 20px;
  }
  .deadline .big{
    font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:17.5px;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    white-space:nowrap;
    color:#E8C77A;
  }
  .deadline .txt{ font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.7; color:#EDE9DC; }
  .deadline .txt b{ color:var(--white); border-bottom:1px solid #E8C77A; }

  /* ---------- Checklist ---------- */
  .checklist{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }
  .check-item{
    display:flex; gap:14px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    padding:12px 15px;
  }
  .check-num{
    font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif;
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:23px;
    color:var(--seal);
    flex:0 0 auto;
    width:28px;
  }
  .check-body .main{ font-size:16.5px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.6; }
  .check-body .note{
    margin-top:6px;
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    line-height:1.7;
    border-top:1px dashed var(--line);
    padding-top:6px;
  }
  .shot-wrap{
    margin-top:12px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--white);
    padding:10px 10px 12px;
  }
  .shot-label{
    display:inline-block;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--white);
    background:var(--gold);
    padding:3px 10px;
    margin-bottom:7px;
  }
  .shot-img{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    height:auto;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .shot-caption{
    margin-top:7px;
    font-size:13.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    line-height:1.6;
  }

  /* ---------- Footnotes ---------- */
  .footnote-list{
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.85;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    padding:12px 18px;
  }
  .footnote-list div{ display:flex; gap:8px; }
  .footnote-list .mark{ color:var(--gold); font-weight:900; flex:0 0 auto; }
  .footnote-list b{ color:var(--ink); font-weight:700; }
  .fn-group{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; }
  .fn-group + .fn-group{ margin-top:10px; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px dashed var(--line); }
  .fn-head{ display:flex; gap:8px; }
  .fn-body{ padding-left:22px; line-height:1.75; }

  .footer{
    margin-top:4px;
    padding-top:12px;
    border-top:3px double var(--ink);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing:1px;
  }

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .inner{ padding:30px 20px 26px; }
    h1{ font-size:24px; }
    .identities{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .header{ flex-direction:column; }
    .stamp{ align-self:flex-end; }
    .rule-flow{ flex-direction:column; }
    .rule-arrow{ transform:rotate(90deg); width:auto; padding:2px 0; }
    .deadline{ flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:6px; }
    .footer{ flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:6px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="sheet">
    <div class="inner">

      <div class="header">
        <div>
          <h1>曝光佈局包資格<br>開放對象<span class="accent">新增</span>公告</h1>
          <div class="subline">即日起，「尚未備查」建案搭贈規則如下　｜　適用單位：協辦組</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stamp">
          <div class="stamp-text">公告</div>
          <div class="stamp-date">即日生效</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 1. 建案身分總覽 -->
      <section>
        <div class="sec-label">
          <div class="sec-num">1</div>
          <div class="sec-title">建案身分總覽</div>
        </div>
        <div class="identities">
          <div class="id-card">
            <div class="tag">身分 A</div>
            <div class="name">正常建案</div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>一般版位</span><span class="pill yes">可購買</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>智能優選</span><span class="pill yes">可購買</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>曝光佈局包</span><span class="pill no">不開放</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>導外再行銷</span><span class="pill no">不開放</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="id-card highlight">
            <div class="tag">身分 B</div>
            <div class="name">尚未備查</div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>一般版位</span><span class="pill yes">可購買</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>智能優選</span><span class="pill limited">有限制</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>曝光佈局包</span><span class="pill yes">可購買一次</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>導外再行銷</span><span class="pill yes">可購買一次</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="id-card">
            <div class="tag">身分 C</div>
            <div class="name">尚未取得建照</div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>一般版位</span><span class="pill limited">有限制</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>智能優選</span><span class="pill no">不開放</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>曝光佈局包</span><span class="pill yes">可購買</span></div>
            <div class="status-row"><span>導外再行銷</span><span class="pill yes">可購買</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footnote-list" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div class="fn-group">
            <div class="fn-head"><span class="mark">＋</span><b>尚未取得建照建案</b></div>
            <div class="fn-body">一般版位「有限制」，不能購買 VIP、更新包、熱區搶手好案、感興趣建案、智能優選。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="fn-group">
            <div class="fn-head"><span class="mark">＋</span><b>尚未備查建案</b></div>
            <div class="fn-body">可同時購買一般版位（智能優選除外）。<br>智能優選須待曝光佈局包走期結束後才可購買；若未購買曝光佈局包，則不受此限制。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. 尚未備查建案使用曝光佈局包的限制 -->
      <section>
        <div class="sec-label">
          <div class="sec-num">2</div>
          <div class="sec-title">「尚未備查」建案使用曝光佈局包的限制</div>
        </div>
        <div class="condition-box">
          <div class="label">適用條件</div>
          預測系統中「未備查建案」欄位顯示 <code>是</code>，即符合資格。
          <div class="or-split">
            <div class="opt">贈送一次曝光佈局包</div>
            <div class="div">或</div>
            <div class="opt">購買一次導外再行銷</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. 年底前開放銷售 -->
      <section>
        <div class="deadline">
          <div class="big">開放銷售至年底</div>
          <div class="txt">「未取得建照」與「未完成備查」之建案，<b>皆可開放銷售至今年年底</b>。</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. 報價時應辦事項 -->
      <section>
        <div class="sec-label">
          <div class="sec-num">3</div>
          <div class="sec-title">報價時應辦事項</div>
        </div>
        <div class="checklist">
          <div class="check-item">
            <div class="check-num">01</div>
            <div class="check-body">
              <div class="main">確認為該建案「第一次」贈送曝光佈局包</div>
              <div class="note">※若為購買「再行銷」，則不需另外確認是否導外——因報價當下協辦無法判斷。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="check-item">
            <div class="check-num">02</div>
            <div class="check-body" style="flex:1;">
              <div class="main">附上「未備查建案」欄位顯示「是」之截圖，並含當下時間戳記</div>
              <div class="shot-wrap">
                <div class="shot-label">示意圖</div>
                <img class="shot-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="未備查建案欄位顯示是之截圖示意">
                <div class="shot-caption">截圖須同時可見「未備查建案」欄位＝是，以及畫面右下角當下時間</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="footer">
        <span>如對適用資格有疑問，請先與主管確認後再行報價</span>
        <span>本公告即日生效</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
